# LF line endings in the repository and in every checkout, so files hashed by the
# release (e.g. proteomic_analysis/07_publication_release/metadata/*.tsv) have the
# same bytes on every machine. proteomic_analysis/06_manuscript_figure_revision/.gitattributes
# keeps the executed figure scripts byte-for-byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.xlsx binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
